      "n": "#25·09",
      "text": "Your set includes a sleeveless V-neck vest top with a front button row and wide-leg trousers in the same soft beige tone. The fabric drapes gently from shoulder to ankle, offering an effortless drape that suits your defined waist while keeping the upper body relaxed."
    },
    {
      "n": "#73·37",
      "text": "These pointed-toe pumps are crafted in dark beige suede with a refined stiletto heel, adding height without sacrificing comfort for long days at work."
    },
    {
      "n": "#127·37",
      "text": "Your handbag is a structured piece made from multicolored woven fabric with brown leather straps and hardware. The playful texture brings depth to your neutral palette while maintaining a sophisticated edge perfect for an office creative setting."
    },
    {
      "n": "#434·37",
      "text": "This slim black belt features a simple metal buckle and smooth leather construction, ready to cinch your waist or serve as a standalone accessory when layered over your set."
    }
